    "text": "Mcallen\nTexas Man Sentenced to 60 Years in Machete Murder Case\nBy Nick,\n6 hours agoA man in Texas was sentenced to 60 years in prison after he was found guilty of murdering another man with a machete. The case begins on June 5, 2024 when officers in McAllen, TX, responded to a residence in order to conduct a wellness check. When they arrived, they didn't seem to find anything and left to come back the next day.\n9",
